# Normalise to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# This project is edited on Windows and deployed to a Raspberry Pi. Without
# this, a Windows clone rewrites every file with CRLF, and the migration
# checksums in schema_migrations stop matching — the runner would report `001`
# as "changed since it was applied" on a machine that had never edited it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The font is binary; never touch it.
*.woff2 binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.db    binary
